{"id":"b7caccb1060f0bd6","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md","title":"真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点","display":"thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness — 真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness","aliases":["91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness — 真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-teller]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness — 真理陈述者产生不同一致固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"724d38bcb2abeb43\" href=\"?note=724d38bcb2abeb43\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller\">91-df-truth-teller</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(J_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (规范强 Kleene 真理跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n的真理陈述者)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\\)</span> (一致固定点类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}non\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\exists\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\left[\n\\tau\\in\\Gamma^+\n\\land\n\\neg\\tau\\in\\Gamma^-\n\\land\n\\Gamma^+\\neq\\Gamma^-\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}non\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\exists\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\left[\n\\tau\\in\\Gamma^+\n\\land\n\\neg\\tau\\in\\Gamma^-\n\\land\n\\Gamma^+\\neq\\Gamma^-\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从分别指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为真、为假且保持一致的初始信息出发，对强 Kleene\n跳跃作闭包，可得到相应固定点。真理陈述者的方程会保持既定选择，却\n不会从空信息自行决定选择。</p>\n<p>原式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\\cup\\{\\tau\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\cup\\{\\tau\\}\\)</span> 或\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\min}\\cup\\{\\neg\\tau\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\min}\\cup\\{\\neg\\tau\\}\\)</span> 一般只是一组种子信息，不必已经对所有\n组合后果闭合；必须取跳跃闭包后才能称为固定点。非唯一性也是具体算子\n的性质，不能由“单调”本身推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-teller","status":"resolved","id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J_{\\mathrm{SK}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}non\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\exists\\Gamma^+,\\Gamma^-\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J_{\\mathrm{SK}})\n\\left[\n\\tau\\in\\Gamma^+\n\\land\n\\neg\\tau\\in\\Gamma^-\n\\land\n\\Gamma^+\\neq\\Gamma^-\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}\\cup\\{\\tau\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\min}\\cup\\{\\neg\\tau\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.m